pkg/ is a collection of utility packages used by sentinez without being specific
to sentinez itself. A package belongs here only if it could possibly be moved 
out into its own repository in the future.
  - common: contains custom packages from other libraries or packages with 
    specific functionality
  - core: implements all core packages runtime, providing a constructor 
    injection mechanism for the entire application
  - infra: contains infrastructure-related packages such as database, cache, etc.
  - std: contains packages specifically made for the project, including config,
    environment variables, and system error templates
